T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sRm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09f497a6-86b9-480c-b860-d9129a5b5ff2","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":":goodpoem:","ts":"1630035995.180400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XeV/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"821f923f-cbd9-47e8-815e-817f274a915f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ピックアップされていた","ts":"1630035884.180100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Owj9G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c9d2b97-c5df-4e00-b532-0aa1bd118722","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/zenn_dev/status/1431094871066955777|https://twitter.com/zenn_dev/status/1431094871066955777\u003e","ts":"1630035877.179700","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/zenn_dev|@zenn_dev\u003e: :black_heart: ピックアップ :sparkles:\n\n新世代の自動補完プラグイン ddc.vim｜Shougo\n\nzenn.dev/shougo/article…","id":1,"author_name":"Zenn公式","author_subname":"@zenn_dev","author_link":"https://twitter.com/zenn_dev/status/1431094871066955777","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1192775453498494977/pb8Shc8G_normal.jpg","text":":black_heart: ピックアップ :sparkles:\n\n新世代の自動補完プラグイン ddc.vim｜Shougo\n\nzenn.dev/shougo/article…","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1630034580,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/zenn_dev/status/1431094871066955777","original_url":"https://twitter.com/zenn_dev/status/1431094871066955777"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uHfC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c5853a6-70d5-4abb-8b90-7596205833d5","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"もしかして、この `;inherits` は nvim-treesitter の独自拡張…？","ts":"1630033079.179400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RGDeD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11e0da34-cf59-4b0b-8856-4e2c728494e0","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter/blob/master/queries/javascript/highlights.scm#L1\u003e\nこういうやつですよね。私もおそらく ecma, jsx の scm を読み込んでるんだろうな、と思います。\ntree-sitter のドキュメントには特に記述が見当たらないな、と思ったらこんなところに説明があった\n\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter/blob/4f2265632becabcd2c5b1791fa31ef278f1e496c/CONTRIBUTING.md#parser-configurations\u003e\n\u0026gt; If your language is an extension of a language (TypeScript is an extension of JavaScript for example), you can include the queries from your base language by adding the following _as the first line of your file_.\n```; inherits: lang1,(optionallang)```\n\u0026gt; If you want to include a language for a given query, but don't want for the queries including the query you qre writing to include it too, you can mark the language as optional (by putting it between parenthesis).","ts":"1630033056.178800","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md | CONTRIBUTING.md\u003e","id":2,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md | CONTRIBUTING.md\u003e","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter|nvim-treesitter/nvim-treesitter\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=HlD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3caff34a-1232-4884-b0ee-8f01d01dd608","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"たぶんこれマジックワードで読み込んでマージしてると思うんですよね。","ts":"1630032450.177700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i7K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e956a34f-8821-46c2-adcd-f2a9ba9fff59","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"inherit 私もよく分からないんですよね…謎","ts":"1630032423.177200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ky7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39e94bb7-d3ef-4b0e-93c9-2a7ee33c6476","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"js がハイライトされないと思ったら inherit なんていうコメントに書かれた特別ルールが入ってるし、よくわからんな。","ts":"1630032396.176800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WCpiu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"139e7012-8ecc-4c56-89f6-330da5c1798a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"いえ。(説明不足)","ts":"1630032241.176000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hK4v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3040e9e-214c-421f-9e50-2d5397ab5844","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"あー、なるほど。AST の葉の種類から直接ハイライト名を得るような設計にされたのですね。失礼しました。","ts":"1630032176.175700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kmx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"22ceb732-9717-4252-a085-5c35f57b0c86","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"特別ルール。 \u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-treesitter/blob/6ca9516b5400d0f25eab23425966d2d5d13debe0/server/generate/main.go#L33-L36\u003e","ts":"1630032085.174700","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-treesitter/blob/6ca9516b5400d0f25eab23425966d2d5d13debe0/server/generate/main.go | main.go\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-treesitter/blob/6ca9516b5400d0f25eab23425966d2d5d13debe0/server/generate/main.go | main.go\u003e","text":"```\n\tr = strings.Replace(r, \"Punctuation\", \"Punct\", -1)\n\tif r != \"Constant\" {\n\t\tr = strings.Replace(r, \"Constant\", \"Const\", -1)\n\t}\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-treesitter|mattn/vim-treesitter\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Rfu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c808f69c-d7af-4706-b406-bae2cebf9239","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"`@keyword.function` から `TSKeywordFunction` の変換も、単純な snake_case to CamelCase では無かったりするし。","ts":"1630032006.174500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZhAT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56aeced4-1472-464b-b5d3-472e803c7121","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"今のデザインは `function_definition` 等から `@keyword.function` そこから `TSKeywordFunction` という回りくどいのをやめて、一意ではなくなりますが `function_definition` から直接 `TSKeywordFunction` を得るという実装にしました。","ts":"1630031941.173700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DQV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b452f07-dad9-4d0a-b746-33e49322d4e2","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"クエリって、ソース全体からそのパターンにマッチした AST を得る物ですが、クエリベースにすると `highlights.scm` に登録されている全てのクエリを投げないと色付けできない事になるのですよね。","ts":"1630031508.172300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cXK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84bc3f93-4784-4706-a0f8-6a0f40c607f0","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ただ一意ではないんですが。一意にするには、AST の階層をクエリに戻して投げないといけなくなりますね。","ts":"1630031329.170700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s2tqq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a03842b-e481-44f9-bdaa-2c8332c9f4da","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あー、僕の方が説明不足でした。クエリが必要ないという話です。既に AST になっていて、その AST に `property_identifier` という識別まで既に割り振られているので、欲しいのはその識別からキャプチャ名への変換だけになるんです。","ts":"1630031262.169900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nX8e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1cc1a84-eeca-41ea-ade6-105081218567","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"\u003c@U03C6TEAZ\u003e 私は Go よく知らないので的外れだったら申し訳ないんですが、以下の関数・構造体でキャプチャ名が取れるんじゃないでしょうか？\nCaptureNameForId: \u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-treesitter/blob/main/server/vendor/github.com/smacker/go-tree-sitter/bindings.go#L677-L681\u003e\nQueryCapture: \u003chttps://github.com/mattn/vim-treesitter/blob/main/server/vendor/github.com/smacker/go-tree-sitter/bindings.go#L734-L737\u003e\nRust と似たような binding であれば、 QueryCapture の index を CaptureNameForId に渡せばキャプチャ名が返ってくるのかなと。","ts":"1630029589.168000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HTg/b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed86fcd4-a74b-47b5-9953-9194e6d12753","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"このコードに、単純な\n```fn main() {\n    println!(\"hello, world!\");\n}```\nというファイルを渡したときの実行結果が以下。\n```QueryMatch { id: 0, pattern_index: 37, captures: [QueryCapture { node: {Node fn (0, 0) - (0, 2)}, index: 13 }] }\nkeyword\nQueryMatch { id: 1, pattern_index: 11, captures: [QueryCapture { node: {Node identifier (0, 3) - (0, 7)}, index: 3 }] }\nfunction\nQueryMatch { id: 4, pattern_index: 18, captures: [QueryCapture { node: {Node ( (0, 7) - (0, 8)}, index: 9 }] }\npunctuation.bracket\nQueryMatch { id: 5, pattern_index: 19, captures: [QueryCapture { node: {Node ) (0, 8) - (0, 9)}, index: 9 }] }\npunctuation.bracket\nQueryMatch { id: 8, pattern_index: 10, captures: [QueryCapture { node: {Node identifier (1, 4) - (1, 11)}, index: 5 }, QueryCapture { node: {Node ! (1, 11) - (1, 12)}, index: 5 }] }\nfunction.macro\nfunction.macro\nQueryMatch { id: 9, pattern_index: 18, captures: [QueryCapture { node: {Node ( (1, 12) - (1, 13)}, index: 9 }] }\npunctuation.bracket\nQueryMatch { id: 10, pattern_index: 68, captures: [QueryCapture { node: {Node string_literal (1, 13) - (1, 28)}, index: 15 }] }\nstring\nQueryMatch { id: 11, pattern_index: 19, captures: [QueryCapture { node: {Node ) (1, 28) - (1, 29)}, index: 9 }] }\npunctuation.bracket\nQueryMatch { id: 12, pattern_index: 26, captures: [QueryCapture { node: {Node ; (1, 29) - (1, 30)}, index: 10 }] }\npunctuation.delimiter```\n使った `highlight.scm` は以下です。\n\u003chttps://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-rust/blob/master/queries/highlights.scm\u003e","ts":"1630020098.165400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oVkc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fc0177e-65b8-4ed7-b4b5-a6dd0d9e11db","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"（スニペットが何をやってもバイナリ扱いされてしまってプレビューできない…）","ts":"1630019962.164200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IfB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85ccc5ce-1dcf-4fcf-ac9b-a4434500af1a","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"```use std::path::PathBuf;\n\nuse anyhow::*;\nuse structopt::StructOpt;\nuse tree_sitter::{Parser, Query, QueryCursor};\n\n#[derive(Debug, Clone, StructOpt)]\nstruct Opts {\n    input: PathBuf,\n    query: PathBuf,\n}\n\nfn main() -\u0026gt; Result\u0026lt;()\u0026gt; {\n    let opts = Opts::from_args();\n\n    let language_rust = tree_sitter_rust::language();\n    let mut parser = Parser::new();\n    parser.set_language(language_rust)?;\n\n    let text =\n        std::fs::read_to_string(opts.input).context(anyhow!(\"The input file is not found!\"))?;\n    let tree = parser\n        .parse(\u0026amp;text, None)\n        .with_context(|| anyhow!(\"parse failed!\"))?;\n    let node = tree.root_node();\n\n    let query_sexp =\n        std::fs::read_to_string(opts.query).context(anyhow!(\"The query file is not found!\"))?;\n    let query = Query::new(language_rust, \u0026amp;query_sexp)?;\n    let cap_names = query.capture_names();\n    let mut qmatch = QueryCursor::new();\n\n    // この第3引数の text_callback が謎\n    for m in qmatch.matches(\u0026amp;query, node, |_| \u0026amp;[]) {\n        println!(\"{:?}\", m);\n        for cap in m.captures {\n            println!(\"{}\", cap_names[cap.index as usize]);\n        }\n    }\n\n    Ok(())\n}```","ts":"1630019944.163700","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1630020524.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sx="}]},{"client_msg_id":"3199d13e-38b9-4b17-804b-7219e09e5b41","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"コードと動作例を見せたほうが早いかもですね。こんな感じです。","ts":"1630019808.161800","files":[{"id":"F02CJD8BFS7","created":0,"timestamp":0,"name":"","title":"","mimetype":"","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"","pretty_type":"","user":"","mode":"tombstone","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":0,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"","url_private_download":"","original_h":0,"original_w":0,"thumb_64":"","thumb_80":"","thumb_160":"","thumb_360":"","thumb_360_gif":"","thumb_360_w":0,"thumb_360_h":0,"thumb_480":"","thumb_480_w":0,"thumb_480_h":0,"thumb_720":"","thumb_720_w":0,"thumb_720_h":0,"thumb_960":"","thumb_960_w":0,"thumb_960_h":0,"thumb_1024":"","thumb_1024_w":0,"thumb_1024_h":0,"permalink":"","permalink_public":"","edit_link":"","preview":"","preview_highlight":"","lines":0,"lines_more":0,"is_public":false,"public_url_shared":false,"channels":null,"groups":null,"ims":null,"initial_comment":{},"comments_count":0,"num_stars":0,"is_starred":false,"shares":{"public":null,"private":null},"display_as_bot":false,"has_rich_preview":false,"username":""}],"upload":true,"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A1xT"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"Go くらいしか、はっきり効果が分かる物がない。","ts":"1629998146.159500","files":[{"id":"F02CVE8DKMX","created":1629998091,"timestamp":1629998091,"name":"image.png","title":"image.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","pretty_type":"PNG","user":"U03C6TEAZ","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_type":"","size":45699,"url":"","url_download":"","url_private":"https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T03C4RC8V-F02CVE